erver-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1464},{"title":"isDocumentFillable\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1626},{"title":"getDocumentFields\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1627},{"title":"getDocumentFieldsType\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1628},{"title":"fillDocumentFields\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1632},{"title":"fillFieldsAndMergeSignature\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1633},{"title":"getFilledDocumentWithSignatureAsBase64\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1634},{"title":"isDocumentFillable\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1828},{"title":"getDocumentFields\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1829},{"title":"getDocumentFieldsType\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1830},{"title":"fillDocumentFields\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1834},{"title":"fillDocumentFieldsAndFlatten\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1835},{"title":"getFilledDocumentWithSignatureAsBase64\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":1836},{"title":"PdfMergeSign​Requestor","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PdfMergeSignRequestorBothAPI.md","line":1916},{"title":"isDocumentFillable\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":2319},{"title":"getDocumentFields\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":2320},{"title":"getDocumentFieldsType\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":2321},{"title":"fillDocumentFields\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":2325},{"title":"fillDocumentFieldsAndFlatten\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":2326},{"title":"fillFieldsAndMergeSignature\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md","line":2327},{"title":"PdfMergeSign​Requestor","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/PdfMergeSignRequestorBothAPI.md","line":2371},{"title":"Redact data from documents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/servicenow-platform/redact-sensitive-data.md","line":2651}],"metadata":{"title":"PDFGenerationAPI - Scoped, Global","description":"The PDFGenerationAPI provides support for PDF conversion and handling PDF fields.Instantiates a new PDFGenerationAPI object.Converts an HTML string to a PDF document.Stages a job that converts an HTML string to a PDF document asynchronously. Asynchronous processing enables you to work in the instance while the PDF conversion is in progress. This is especially helpful for larger PDF exports.Converts an HTML string into a PDF with header and footer content.Stages a job that converts an HTML string into a PDF with header and footer content asynchronously. Asynchronous processing enables you to work in the instance while the PDF conversion is in progress. This is especially helpful for larger PDF exports.Fills fields in an editable PDF and attaches it to the provided record.Fills fields in an editable PDF, flattens the data fields, and attaches it to the provided record.Fills fields in an editable PDF, adds signature image, flattens the data fields, and attaches it to the provided record.Gets a list of editable fields in a PDF document. Enables listing editable PDF fields without manually opening the file to check.Gets the field type of set of editable fields from a PDF document.Fills fields in an editable PDF, creates an image, and converts it to a Base64-encoded PDF.Gets the page size of a PDF document.Checks if the PDF document contains editable fields.Applies redaction to a PDF document based on the given rectangle coordinates, search keywords, or both. A redacted copy of the original PDF is generated in the Attachments \\[sys\\_attachment\\] table.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":46,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[73,75],[173,238],[294,307],[311,313],[411,474],[507,520],[524,526],[626,846],[911,972],[996,1000],[1002,1102],[1322,1418],[1442,1446],[1448,1559],[1604,1612],[1616,1618],[1726,1730],[1753,1798],[1814,1818],[1820,1940],[1944,1967],[2012,2026],[2030,2032],[2062,2072],[2074,2108],[2113,2117],[2119,2149],[2159,2163],[2173,2179],[2196,2201],[2278,2283],[2287,2309],[2395,2399],[2453,2468],[2498,2508],[2510,2543],[2548,2552],[2555,2585],[2632,2637],[2641,2643],[2682,2708],[2718,2815],[2858,2888],[2892,2896]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/PDFGenerationAPIBothAPI.md"},
